# Providers
### [Config](https://opencode.ai/docs/providers/#config)
#### [Base URL](https://opencode.ai/docs/providers/#base-url)
```
{

  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",

  "provider": {

    "anthropic": {

      "options": {

        "baseURL": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1"

      }

    }

  }

}
```

## [Custom provider](https://opencode.ai/docs/providers/#custom-provider)
```
$ /connect




┌  Add credential

│

▲  This only stores a credential for myprovider - you will need to configure it in opencode.json, check the docs for examples.

│

◇  Enter your API key

│  sk-...

└
```

```
{

     "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",

     "provider": {

       "myprovider": {

         "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",

         "name": "My AI ProviderDisplay Name",

         "options": {

           "baseURL": "https://api.myprovider.com/v1"

         },

         "models": {

           "my-model-name": {

             "name": "My Model Display Name"

           }

         }

       }

     }

}
```

##### [Example](https://opencode.ai/docs/providers/#example)
```
{

  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",

  "provider": {

    "myprovider": {

      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",

      "name": "My AI ProviderDisplay Name",

      "options": {

        "baseURL": "https://api.myprovider.com/v1",

        "apiKey": "{env:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}",

        "headers": {

          "Authorization": "Bearer custom-token"

        }

      },

      "models": {

        "my-model-name": {

          "name": "My Model Display Name",

          "limit": {

            "context": 200000,

            "output": 65536

          }

        }

      }

    }

  }

}
```

# Custom OpenAI-compatible provider options not being passed to API calls
## Expected Behavior
- The `baseURL` and `apiKey` from configuration should be passed to the `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible` provider

